  <data name="pricing_faq_q1" xml:space="preserve"><value>What's the catch with Free tier?</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_a1" xml:space="preserve"><value>Free tier is instant delivery — your file stays available for 2 hours. After that, it's permanently deleted. This lets us offer huge 5 GB transfers for free. Need longer? Upgrade to Pro.</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_q2" xml:space="preserve"><value>Are my files compressed?</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_a2" xml:space="preserve"><value>Never. What you upload is what the recipient downloads — byte for byte. No compression, no re-encoding. Photographers and video editors trust us for this.</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_q3" xml:space="preserve"><value>How fast are downloads?</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_a3" xml:space="preserve"><value>Files transfer through Cloudflare's global edge network. No server bottleneck, no throttling.</value></data>
