  <data name="pricing_faq_a4" xml:space="preserve"><value>Yes! Change your plan anytime. Upgrades take effect immediately.</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_q5" xml:space="preserve"><value>Is there a free trial?</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_a5" xml:space="preserve"><value>All paid plans include a 14-day free trial. No credit card required.</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_q6" xml:space="preserve"><value>Do recipients need an account?</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_a6" xml:space="preserve"><value>No. Recipients download directly in their browser — no account, no app required.</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_q7" xml:space="preserve"><value>What happens if I cancel?</value></data>
  <data name="pricing_faq_a7" xml:space="preserve"><value>Your files remain accessible for 7 days after cancellation.</value></data>
